{"seq":1,"slug":"kafka-architecture","title":"Kafka 架构与运维实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/infrastructure/kafka-architecture","wordCount":1283,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"kafka-架构与运维实践\">Kafka 架构与运维实践</h1><p>Apache Kafka 是目前使用最广泛的事件流平台，被 LinkedIn、Netflix、Uber 等公司用于处理每秒数百万条消息。理解 Kafka 的内部架构是构建可靠事件驱动系统的基础。本文从 Partition 模型到 Consumer Group，从消息投递语义到日志压缩，提供系统性的 Kafka 工程知识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Partition</strong></td>\n<td>Topic 的物理分片，并行消费的基本单位</td>\n<td>数量决定最大并行度，只能增加不能减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Consumer Group</strong></td>\n<td>共同消费一个 Topic 的消费者集合</td>\n<td>每个 Partition 只被组内一个消费者消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Offset</strong></td>\n<td>消息在 Partition 中的唯一位置编号</td>\n<td>消费者通过提交 Offset 记录消费进度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>幂等生产者</strong></td>\n<td>为每条消息分配序列号，Broker 端去重</td>\n<td>防止网络重传导致重复写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Rebalance</strong></td>\n<td>Consumer Group 成员变化时重新分配 Partition</td>\n<td>期间消费暂停，是性能敏感操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Log Compaction</strong></td>\n<td>保留每个 Key 的最新消息，删除旧版本</td>\n<td>适合状态快照场景，与时间保留互斥</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kafka-核心架构\">Kafka 核心架构</h2><h3 id=\"基本概念层级\">基本概念层级</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Cluster[Kafka Cluster] --&gt; Broker1[Broker 1]&#10;    Cluster --&gt; Broker2[Broker 2]&#10;    Cluster --&gt; Broker3[Broker 3]&#10;    Broker1 --&gt; T1P0[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Leader]&#10;    Broker2 --&gt; T1P1[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Leader]&#10;    Broker3 --&gt; T1P2[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 2&lt;br/&gt;Leader]&#10;    Broker2 --&gt; T1P0R[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Replica]&#10;    Broker3 --&gt; T1P1R[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Replica]&#10;    Broker1 --&gt; T1P2R[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 2&lt;br/&gt;Replica]\">graph TD\n    Cluster[Kafka Cluster] --&gt; Broker1[Broker 1]\n    Cluster --&gt; Broker2[Broker 2]\n    Cluster --&gt; Broker3[Broker 3]\n    Broker1 --&gt; T1P0[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Leader]\n    Broker2 --&gt; T1P1[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Leader]\n    Broker3 --&gt; T1P2[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 2&lt;br/&gt;Leader]\n    Broker2 --&gt; T1P0R[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 0&lt;br/&gt;Replica]\n    Broker3 --&gt; T1P1R[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 1&lt;br/&gt;Replica]\n    Broker1 --&gt; T1P2R[Topic: orders&lt;br/&gt;Partition 2&lt;br/&gt;Replica]</pre><p><strong>关键概念：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Topic</strong></td>\n<td>消息分类，类似消息频道</td>\n<td>数据库中的表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Partition</strong></td>\n<td>Topic 的物理分片，是并行的单位</td>\n<td>数据库表的分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Offset</strong></td>\n<td>消息在 Partition 中的唯一位置编号</td>\n<td>数组下标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Broker</strong></td>\n<td>Kafka 服务节点，存储 Partition 数据</td>\n<td>数据库服务器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Leader</strong></td>\n<td>Partition 的主副本，承接读写</td>\n<td>主从中的主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Replica</strong></td>\n<td>Partition 的从副本，异步同步</td>\n<td>主从中的从</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"partition-设计原则\">Partition 设计原则</h3><p>Partition 数量是 Kafka 最重要的配置，直接决定并行消费能力的上限：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Consumer Group 中的消费者数量 &lt;= Partition 数量&#10;（多余的消费者会处于空闲状态）&#10;&#10;最大并行消费度 = Partition 数量\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Consumer Group 中的消费者数量 &#x3C;= Partition 数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>（多余的消费者会处于空闲状态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最大并行消费度 = Partition 数量</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Partition 数量设计建议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>建议 Partition 数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发/测试环境</td>\n<td>3-6</td>\n<td>够用即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低吞吐量生产（&lt; 100MB/s）</td>\n<td>6-12</td>\n<td>留有扩展余地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中高吞吐量（100MB/s - 1GB/s）</td>\n<td>24-48</td>\n<td>按目标消费者数设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高吞吐量（&gt; 1GB/s）</td>\n<td>100+</td>\n<td>结合 Broker 数量计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：Partition 数量只能增加不能减少，上线前需仔细规划。</p>\n<h3 id=\"消息键与分区策略\">消息键与分区策略</h3><p>Kafka 根据消息键（Key）决定消息写入哪个 Partition：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 相同 customerId 的消息总是写入同一 Partition，保证顺序&#10;producer.send(new ProducerRecord&lt;&gt;(&#10;    &quot;order-events&quot;,&#10;    customerId,    // key：决定分区&#10;    orderEventJson // value：消息内容&#10;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 相同 customerId 的消息总是写入同一 Partition，保证顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProducerRecord&#x3C;>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"order-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    customerId,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// key：决定分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    orderEventJson </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// value：消息内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>分区策略选择：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Key 为 null] --&gt; B[轮询分配&lt;br/&gt;Round-robin&lt;br/&gt;最均衡负载]&#10;    C[Key 不为 null] --&gt; D[Hash 分区&lt;br/&gt;murmur2 hash key&lt;br/&gt;相同 key 同一分区]&#10;    E[自定义] --&gt; F[实现 Partitioner 接口&lt;br/&gt;按业务逻辑路由]\">graph LR\n    A[Key 为 null] --&gt; B[轮询分配&lt;br/&gt;Round-robin&lt;br/&gt;最均衡负载]\n    C[Key 不为 null] --&gt; D[Hash 分区&lt;br/&gt;murmur2 hash key&lt;br/&gt;相同 key 同一分区]\n    E[自定义] --&gt; F[实现 Partitioner 接口&lt;br/&gt;按业务逻辑路由]</pre><h2 id=\"consumer-group-机制\">Consumer Group 机制</h2><h3 id=\"consumer-group-的再均衡-rebalance\">Consumer Group 的再均衡（Rebalance）</h3><p>当 Consumer Group 中的成员变化时（新增消费者、消费者崩溃），Kafka 会触发<strong>再均衡（Rebalance）</strong>，重新分配 Partition 给各消费者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant CG as Consumer Group&#10;    participant K as Kafka Coordinator&#10;&#10;    Note over CG: Consumer A 崩溃&#10;    K-&gt;&gt;K: 检测到成员变化&#10;    K-&gt;&gt;CG: 触发 Rebalance&#10;    Note over CG: 所有消费者暂停消费&#10;    K-&gt;&gt;CG: 重新分配 Partition&#10;    Note over CG: Consumer B 接管 Consumer A 的 Partition&#10;    CG-&gt;&gt;K: 消费恢复\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant CG as Consumer Group\n    participant K as Kafka Coordinator\n\n    Note over CG: Consumer A 崩溃\n    K-&gt;&gt;K: 检测到成员变化\n    K-&gt;&gt;CG: 触发 Rebalance\n    Note over CG: 所有消费者暂停消费\n    K-&gt;&gt;CG: 重新分配 Partition\n    Note over CG: Consumer B 接管 Consumer A 的 Partition\n    CG-&gt;&gt;K: 消费恢复</pre><p>Rebalance 期间消费者停止处理消息，是<strong>性能敏感</strong>的操作。减少 Rebalance 的策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 使用静态成员ID，避免短暂重启触发 Rebalance&#10;Properties props = new Properties();&#10;props.put(&quot;group.instance.id&quot;, &quot;consumer-instance-1&quot;); // 静态成员ID&#10;props.put(&quot;session.timeout.ms&quot;, &quot;30000&quot;);  // 增大超时，减少误判崩溃&#10;&#10;// 使用 CooperativeStickyAssignor（增量 Rebalance，只迁移必要的 Partition）&#10;props.put(&quot;partition.assignment.strategy&quot;,&#10;          &quot;org.apache.kafka.clients.consumer.CooperativeStickyAssignor&quot;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用静态成员ID，避免短暂重启触发 Rebalance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Properties props </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group.instance.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"consumer-instance-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 静态成员ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session.timeout.ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30000\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 增大超时，减少误判崩溃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 CooperativeStickyAssignor（增量 Rebalance，只迁移必要的 Partition）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"partition.assignment.strategy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          \"org.apache.kafka.clients.consumer.CooperativeStickyAssignor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"offset-管理\">Offset 管理</h3><p>Consumer 通过提交 Offset 来记录消费进度。提交策略影响消息投递语义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 自动提交（At-least-once，可能重复处理）&#10;props.put(&quot;enable.auto.commit&quot;, &quot;true&quot;);&#10;props.put(&quot;auto.commit.interval.ms&quot;, &quot;5000&quot;);&#10;&#10;// 手动提交（更精确控制）&#10;props.put(&quot;enable.auto.commit&quot;, &quot;false&quot;);&#10;&#10;while (true) {&#10;    ConsumerRecords&lt;String, String&gt; records = consumer.poll(Duration.ofMillis(100));&#10;&#10;    for (ConsumerRecord&lt;String, String&gt; record : records) {&#10;        processRecord(record);  // 先处理&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 批量提交：处理完一批后才提交&#10;    consumer.commitSync();  // 同步提交，确保成功&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动提交（At-least-once，可能重复处理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enable.auto.commit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto.commit.interval.ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"5000\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 手动提交（更精确控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enable.auto.commit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ConsumerRecords&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> records </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consumer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">poll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofMillis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ConsumerRecord&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> record </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> records) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        processRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(record);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 先处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 批量提交：处理完一批后才提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    consumer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">commitSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//