er.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ConsumerRecord&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> record </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> records) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 处理并发布到输出 Topic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            String processed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(record.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProducerRecord&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"processed-orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, record.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), processed));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 将消费者 offset 也纳入事务，确保\"消费 + 发布\"原子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TopicPartition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OffsetAndMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> offsets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getOffsets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(records);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendOffsetsToTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(offsets, consumer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">groupMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">commitTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Exception </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abortTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"log-compaction-日志压缩\">Log Compaction（日志压缩）</h2><p>Kafka 有两种数据保留策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Delete（时间/大小保留）</strong></td>\n<td>超过时间或大小后删除旧消息</td>\n<td>事件流（按时间窗口处理）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Compact（日志压缩）</strong></td>\n<td>保留每个 Key 的最新消息</td>\n<td>状态快照、配置分发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>日志压缩的工作原理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"原始日志：&#10;Offset 0: key=user-1, value={&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alice&quot;,&quot;email&quot;:&quot;old@a.com&quot;}&#10;Offset 1: key=user-2, value={&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Bob&quot;}&#10;Offset 2: key=user-1, value={&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alice&quot;,&quot;email&quot;:&quot;new@a.com&quot;}  ← 同 key 的新版本&#10;Offset 3: key=user-3, value={&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Charlie&quot;}&#10;Offset 4: key=user-2, value=null  ← Tombstone：删除标记&#10;&#10;压缩后日志（保留每个 key 的最新值）：&#10;Offset 2: key=user-1, value={&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alice&quot;,&quot;email&quot;:&quot;new@a.com&quot;}&#10;Offset 3: key=user-3, value={&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Charlie&quot;}&#10;（user-2 被 tombstone 删除，不再出现）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原始日志：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Offset 0: key=user-1, value={\"name\":\"Alice\",\"email\":\"old@a.com\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Offset 1: key=user-2, value={\"name\":\"Bob\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Offset 2: key=user-1, value={\"name\":\"Alice\",\"email\":\"new@a.com\"}  ← 同 key 的新版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Offset 3: key=user-3, value={\"name\":\"Charlie\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Offset 4: key=user-2, value=null  ← Tombstone：删除标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>压缩后日志（保留每个 key 的最新值）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Offset 2: key=user-1, value={\"name\":\"Alice\",\"email\":\"new@a.com\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Offset 3: key=user-3, value={\"name\":\"Charlie\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>（user-2 被 tombstone 删除，不再出现）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>日志压缩配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# topic 级别配置&#10;cleanup.policy=compact&#10;min.cleanable.dirty.ratio=0.5  # 脏消息比例达到50%才触发压缩&#10;segment.ms=86400000            # 每天滚动一个 segment\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># topic 级别配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cleanup.policy=compact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>min.cleanable.dirty.ratio=0.5  # 脏消息比例达到50%才触发压缩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>segment.ms=86400000            # 每天滚动一个 segment</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"关键生产配置\">关键生产配置</h2><h3 id=\"生产者关键配置\">生产者关键配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"properties\" data-code=\"# 可靠性&#10;acks=all                                    # 所有副本确认，最高可靠性&#10;retries=2147483647                          # 允许无限重试&#10;delivery.timeout.ms=120000                  # 总投递超时 2 分钟&#10;&#10;# 性能&#10;batch.size=65536                            # 批量发送大小（64KB）&#10;linger.ms=10                                # 等待批量积累时间（10ms）&#10;compression.type=lz4                        # 压缩算法&#10;&#10;# 幂等性（Kafka &gt;= 0.11）&#10;enable.idempotence=true&#10;max.in.flight.requests.per.connection=5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 可靠性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>acks=all                                    # 所有副本确认，最高可靠性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>retries=2147483647                          # 允许无限重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>delivery.timeout.ms=120000                  # 总投递超时 2 分钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 性能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>batch.size=65536                            # 批量发送大小（64KB）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>linger.ms=10                                # 等待批量积累时间（10ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compression.type=lz4                        # 压缩算法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 幂等性（Kafka >= 0.11）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enable.idempotence=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max.in.flight.requests.per.connection=5</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"消费者关键配置\">消费者关键配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"properties\" data-code=\"# 可靠性&#10;auto.offset.reset=earliest                  # 新消费组从最早消息开始&#10;enable.auto.commit=false                    # 手动管理 offset&#10;&#10;# 性能&#10;fetch.min.bytes=65536                       # 最小拉取 64KB&#10;fetch.max.wait.ms=500                       # 最长等待 500ms&#10;max.poll.records=500                        # 每次最多拉取 500 条&#10;&#10;# 会话管理&#10;session.timeout.ms=30000                    # 30秒无心跳视为崩溃&#10;heartbeat.interval.ms=10000                 # 每 10 秒发一次心跳&#10;max.poll.interval.ms=300000                 # 处理一批消息最长 5 分钟\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 可靠性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>auto.offset.reset=earliest                  # 新消费组从最早消息开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enable.auto.commit=false                    # 手动管理 offset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 性能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fetch.min.bytes=65536                       # 最小拉取 64KB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fetch.max.wait.ms=500                       # 最长等待 500ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max.poll.records=500                        # 每次最多拉取 500 条</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 会话管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>session.timeout.ms=30000                    # 30秒无心跳视为崩溃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>heartbeat.interval.ms=10000                 # 每 10 秒发一次心跳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max.poll.interval.ms=300000                 # 处理一批消息最长 5 分钟</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"监控关键指标\">监控关键指标</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>告警阈值建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>consumer_lag</code></td>\n<td>消费者落后的消息数</td>\n<td>&gt; 业务可接受的积压量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>under_replicated_partitions</code></td>\n<td>副本不足的 Partition 数</td>\n<td>&gt; 0 立即告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>request_latency_avg</code></td>\n<td>Produce/Fetch 平均延迟</td>\n<td>根据 SLA 设定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bytes_in_per_sec</code></td>\n<td>入站字节率</td>\n<td>接近 Broker 带宽上限告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>active_controller_count</code></td>\n<td>活跃控制器数</td>\n<td>!= 1 立即告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Kafka 运维关键检查项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Consumer Lag 监控</strong>：<code>kafka_consumergroup_lag</code> 是事件驱动系统最核心的健康指标，应按业务 SLA 设置分级告警（warning/critical）</li>\n<li><strong>副本不足告警</strong>：<code>under_replicated_partitions &gt; 0</code> 表示数据可靠性风险，需立即处置</li>\n<li><strong>控制器健康</strong>：<code>active_controller_count != 1</code> 表示集群元数据异常，优先级最高</li>\n<li><strong>磁盘使用率</strong>：Broker 磁盘使用超过 80% 时需要扩容或调整保留策略</li>\n<li><strong>JVM GC 监控</strong>：Full GC 频繁会引发 Broker 响应延迟，影响生产者吞吐量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"兄弟文档参考\">兄弟文档参考</h2><p>本文深入 Kafka 架构；如需选型考量（Kafka vs 其他平台），参见本章的事件流平台选型文档；Kafka 与 Schema Registry 集成的具体配置，参见本章 Schema 注册与演化文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Kafka 的高吞吐量源于三个关键设计：顺序写磁盘、零拷贝和 Pull 消费模型。Partition 是并发的基本单位，设计时需一次性规划好（不可减少）。Consumer Group 的 Rebalance 是性能敏感点，优先使用 <code>CooperativeStickyAssignor</code> 和静态成员 ID 减少停顿。生产端 Exactly-once 需同时开启幂等生产者（<code>enable.idempotence=true</code>）和事务 API，消费端需配置 <code>isolation.level=read_committed</code>。Log Compaction 适合配置/状态分发场景，与基于时间的 Delete 策略是两种互斥的保留策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Kafka 架构与运维实践","id":"kafka-架构与运维实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Kafka 核心架构","id":"kafka-核心架构"},{"level":3,"text":"基本概念层级","id":"基本概念层级"},{"level":3,"text":"Partition 设计原则","id":"partition-设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"消息键与分区策略","id":"消息键与分区策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Consumer Group 机制","id":"consumer-group-机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Consumer Group 的再均衡（Rebalance）","id":"consumer-group-的再均衡-rebalance"},{"level":3,"text":"Offset 管理","id":"offset-管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Kafka 的 Exactly-once 语义（EOS）","id":"kafka-的-exactly-once-语义-eos"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等生产者","id":"幂等生产者"},{"level":3,"text":"事务 API：消费-处理-生产的原子操作","id":"事务-api-消费-处理-生产的原子操作"},{"level":2,"text":"Log Compaction（日志压缩）","id":"log-compaction-日志压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"关键生产配置","id":"关键生产配置"},{"level":3,"text":"生产者关键配置","id":"生产者关键配置"},{"level":3,"text":"消费者关键配置","id":"消费者关键配置"},{"level":2,"text":"监控关键指标","id":"监控关键指标"},{"level":2,"text":"兄弟文档参考","id":"兄弟文档参考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"最终一致性保障机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/foundations/eventual-consistency"},"next":{"title":"事件流平台选型：Kafka、Pulsar、Redpanda 与 EventBridge","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/infrastructure/platform-comparison"}}